ok - enabled: one resolved carrier is recorded in meta and the identical TRACEPARENT is exported before launch
ok - enabled: the pane receives OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES matching the meta, after TRACEPARENT and before the launch
ok - disabled: no OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES export or retention term anywhere in the pane input
ok - allowlist on: the launch environment retains OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES beside TRACEPARENT
ok - trace_started recorded on the mint and preserved across relaunch; one firstmate.spawn span per launch with the relaunch attributes
ok - disabled: no span posted and no trace_started recorded
ok - disabled: neither traceparent= in meta nor a TRACEPARENT export is produced
not ok - the off decision must unset TRACEPARENT in the launch command
